{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54841","headline":"兵要望江南 占鼠第十八（京本列第十○十首） 十 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占鼠第十八（京本列第十○十首） 十","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"将军卧，眼上被鼠伤（京本作「将军服，上祍鼠来伤」）。\n必有奸贼（京本作「喜神」）来（辛本、川本、京本作「看」）在即，或伤腰下不相当，财散（京本作「破」）客军强。\n（经曰：「鼠者，贼也。\n如有变易，必主奸寇入也。\n」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54841.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54841","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}